    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "111th birthday",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "曾祖母が111歳の皇寿を迎えたので、親戚一同が集まってお祝いをした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "皇寿のお祝いとして、市から記念品と感謝状が贈られた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「皇」の字を分解すると「白」と「王（一一一）」になることが、皇寿の由来だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "）百発砲声破早晨、異邦猶見歳華新、挙杯先祝天皇寿、不背真為日本民。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "西航日録",
                "author": "井上円了",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
